THE MINISTER OF SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY AND MINISTER OF EARTH SCIENCES (SHRI KAPIL SIBAL): Sir, I beg to lay the statement on the status of implementation on recommendations pertaining to Department of Science and Technology in the one hundred ninety-fifth (195th) Report of the Departmentally-related Parliamentary Standing Committee on Science and Technology, Environment and Forests on the direction of the hon. Speaker, Lok Sabha, in pursuance of the provisions of Rule 389 of the Rules of Procedure and Conduct of Business in the Lok Sabha issued vide Lok Sabha Bulletin Part II dated September 1, 2004. 

